  "name": "Clone",
  "type": "npc",
  "img": "icons/svg/mystery-man.svg",
  "system": {
    "details": {
      "build": "character",
      "level": 1,
      "template": "clone",
      "creatureType": "construct",
      "blurb": "Clone jutsu (Shadow Clone Technique and the release Clones)",
      "summonRole": "Clone",
      "biography": "<p><em>Clone</em> (the Clone keyword: Shadow Clone Technique; Earth, Explosive, Water and Lightning Clones). You command a clone by spending your Action or Bonus Action as its jutsu says.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> your Ninjutsu save DC, DR 6 · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 1 · <strong>Jutsu Slots</strong> 2 · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft. <strong>Abilities</strong> none (−). <strong>Senses</strong> the same special senses as its caster.</p><p><strong>Clone adjustments.</strong> Shadow Clone Technique: at B-Rank or S-Rank, +1 Jutsu Slot; at A-Rank it can cast A-Rank jutsu; out of combat, clones can travel up to 1 mile from their caster. Earth Clone: 20 hit points; immune to Genjutsu, psychic and poison damage; resists bludgeoning, earth and cold; vulnerable to lightning; two Clone Strikes; Earth Release jutsu only. Explosive Clone: no Clone Strike; Fire Release jutsu only; detonates at 0 hit points (see the jutsu). Water Clone: Water Release Ninjutsu only; can concentrate on its jutsu (one clone at a time). Lightning Clone: Lightning Release Ninjutsu only; immune to Genjutsu, psychic and poison damage; speed equal to its summoner's or 50, whichever is higher; discharges at 0 hit points (see the jutsu).</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> its level, AC, attack bonuses, save DCs, skills and senses are set from yours.</p>"
    },
